# Lost Vikings v2 input recording — co-op smoke scenario (UX stage 8)
# coop3_walk with player 2's moves as bits events (2026-10-06): B0100@2 = the RIGHT bit of player 2's
# game controller, B8000@2 = its A button — the form a recording gives a pad's buttons, applied as bits
# (no keyboard key behind them). The lockstep bench and the smoke bench run it beside the named form:
# the end state must equal coop3_walk's, since the bits are the same.
# coop 3
# player 1: the keyboard's actions; players 2 and 3: the same action names with @2 / @3 (their bits)
